...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

pipeline: 계획 파이프라인 (PlanningPipeline) { class: ours }
project_coordinator: 프로젝트 코디네이터 (ProjectCoordinator) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

pipeline -> project_coordinator: 호출 (3단계, SequentialAgent)
project_coordinator -> gemini: instruction + 렌더링 도구 선언 + 대화 기록
gemini -> project_coordinator: function_call generate_renovation_rendering(prompt, aspect_ratio, asset_name)
